window.products.push({"id":112005,"name":"Fieemoo Portable Dryer, Electric Foldable Clothes Dryer with 3 Drying Mode & Intelligent Timer, 110V 1350W Standing Garment Steamer for Clothes with A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d3-Je+pvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👔AUTOMATIC NATURAL LAUNDRY CARE: With Aluminum alloy element heating technology and up to 1350W steaming power & 1000W drying power, our electric clothes dryer is committed to dry your clothes efficiently in 180mins maximum for 3 to 5 clothes while protecting fabrics, keeping clothes fluffy and preventing creases. 👗3 DRYING MODE & AROMATHERAPY: In addition to drying, our garment steamer also has a powerful wrinkle removal function, which takes only less than 60mins. The intelligent timer function sets you free to do other stuff. Moreover, put the aroma tablets into the aroma box will help remove odors and keep your clothes fresh and clean. 👖PORTABLE & FOLDBLE DESIGN: This portable clothes dryer is equiped with universal wheels and weighs only 20.9lbs, which allows you to move it easily to anywhere. The poles in two sides can be taken down to fold the dryer. It's compact size is perfect for carrying or taking out. Suitable for apartments, dormitories, motor homes, RV's, and more. 👕PREMIUM QUALITY & SAFETY: Our portable dryer owns a high density fabric cover to prevent from getting moisture and dust. The alumium poles in two sides with high load capacity and durability, can be extended to adjust the height. When the water in the boiler is evaporated, current overload or the dryer is dumped, the temperature control device will automatically disconnect to prevent a safety accident. 👚BUY WORRY-FREE: We promise that the products will be replaced free of charge due to quality problems within 1 year. If you encounter other problems during install or use, please contact us by after-sales mail on the manual, we wil answer within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d3-Je+pvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fieemoo","source_asin":"B0B8YXYXDN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8YXYXDN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8YXYXDN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
