window.products.push({"id":112010,"name":"Beaquicy STV-90 Dryer Duct Connector - Snap to Vent 90 Elbow - Indoor Hook-up Dryer Vent Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uLm0OIZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【PRODUCT DESCRIPTION】: The STV-90 dryer duct exhaust connector consists of a buckle to the exhaust 90 elbow, a buckle connector and a sealing ring connected to the wall conduit or dryer conduit. 90 degree diameter elbow dryer connectors are used to attach semi-rigid or flexible dryer hoses without hose clamps. Made of silicone and other sturdy materials to ensure that dryer hose vent fittings do not crack, tear or squeeze when using connectors. ✅【AIRTIGHT】: STV-90 dryer conduit connector Universal dryer connector for electric and gas dryers. The silicon seal ring of STV-90 dryer pipe connector provides you with a sealed dryer connection. The silicone seal has a strong viscosity and is not easy to fall off, making your dryer more efficient while consuming less energy, allowing clothes to dry faster and saving electricity. ✅【90 DAYS WARRANTY】:The STV-90 dryer duct exhaust connector supports 90 days return and exchange. Our company attaches great importanc e to the shopping experience of each customer. Risk-free shopping, if you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBILITY】:STV-90 dryer duct exhaust connector 5.5 inches. L x 6 inches. H x 4.25 inches. Suitable for most brand dryers. This dryer hose connector is easy to clean, and the sturdy construction prevents breakage, tearing or other possible damage to the connector. In the air duct joint of the dryer, the silicone seal has strong viscosity and is not easy to fall off, which can form a good seal between the pipe and the joint. ✅【EASY INSTALLATION】:Installation is very simple and requires no additional tools, snap the hose to the STV-90 dryer exhaust connector, place the seal ring on the wall or dryer pipe, and push the connector onto the pipe for quick, gas-tight and easy dryer installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uLm0OIZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08KW183JW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KW183JW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KW183JW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
