window.products.push({"id":112026,"name":"hOmeLabs Large Countertop Ice Maker – Chewable Nugget Ice Machine with 44 lb Production Per Day – 3.3 lb Drawer Capacity – Digital Touch Panel – Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aUlCH5JmL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Portable Ice Machine – Whether you’re planning an outdoor party or just a simple dinner party inside your home, serving up cool drinks is easy through the hOmeLabs Large Countertop Ice Maker. With dimensions of 9.8 W × 16.1 D × 19.0 H in and a 6 ft long cord, you can move it and use it anywhere you want. Be Your Own Bartender – Beat the heat with perfectly iced cocktails and beverages that you can easily make on a hot summer day. In the mood for margarita or a mojito? Maybe you’re craving for a lemonade, smoothie, milkshake, or iced coffee? This ice maker is your best pal in creating those delicious, chilled drinks right in the comfort of your own home. It comes with an ice scoop, too. Modern and Durable – This nugget ice machine has a sleek, modern design that makes it easy to match any kitchen interior. With a glossy black plastic and stainless steel housing, it will look good on any large kitchen countertop or kitchen island with a power source. This kitchen must-have was also built with durability in mind. Intuitive Control Panel – The easy to use, smart LED Control Panel on this machine enables you to produce 9 pcs of nugget-shaped ice per cycle with a single touch of the ICE button. The FULL indicator will light up once the ice drawer is full and the unit will stop producing ice automatically. The WATER indicator will light up to warn you that the unit needs more water to continue operation. Touch the LIGHT button to turn on the blue LED light and party the night away! One Touch Cleaning – This large countertop ice machine has a self-cleaning function that runs with just a single touch of the CLEAN button. If it’s to be used for the first time, or it hasn’t been used for a long time, run the clean mode first. Cleaning only takes a maximum of 20 min. The drip tray is removable and easy to clean too. Weekly cleaning is recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aUlCH5JmL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hOmeLabs","source_asin":"B08SMQK46G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SMQK46G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SMQK46G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
