window.products.push({"id":112053,"name":"Reusable Coffee Filter, 4 Pack Basket Coffee Filters 8-12 Cup Replacement Coffee Filter with Stainless Steel Mesh Bottom for Mr. Coffee and Black & De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GvRGNdgNL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"The new day begins and you can enjoy a perfect cup of coffee. Use a reusable stainless steel mesh bottom filter to refurbish your brewer to enhance the flavor of the coffee. It is easy to clean and does not reduce flavor or damage the coffee grounds of fresh coffee. This will give you an unprecedented feeling. Our mesh filter is essential for everyone who likes coffee. Compatible with DGB-500, DGB-600 Series , Black & Decker, Cuisinart GTF-B, Continental, Hamilton Beach, Proctor Silex, Bonavita, KRUPS KM785D50, Breville BDC.... Package Included: 4xReusable Coffee Filter Color: Gold/Black Why choose our products? There are some ideas on the coffee filter: Environmental protection: Our filter does not require a paper filter, save the planet by removing the waste paper filter! It can be reused after being rinsed with clean water, reducing excessive forest use and saving resources.  Cost-effective: No longer buying paper filters, this is the best way to save money and energy in the long run. Reduce excessive forest use and save resources. Stop wasting money and time on the wrong coffee filter. Cleaning the filter directly can save time and do many other things.  Improve overall taste: Our stainless steel mesh filter provides greater flow for more balanced brewing. Allowing natural coffee bean oil to penetrate can fully enhance the flavor of coffee. Make it taste better.  Easy to clean: The golden filter is very smooth and can be easily rinsed inside and out under water, or it can be cleaned in a dishwasher. There is no need to worry that it will sometimes be messed up like a paper basket filter that falls into the paper basket.  High durability: There are 6 side grids, which can be used longer. You can rest assured that you can save a lot of money without frequent purchases. And more...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GvRGNdgNL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InwodiTeki","source_asin":"B08BCMCR1B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BCMCR1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BCMCR1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
