window.products.push({"id":112195,"name":"Ultra Durable 8536974 Dryer Drum Support Roller Replacement part by BlueStars – Exact Fit For Whirlpool, Kenmore & Maytag - Replaces 8536973 W10314171","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R1AgX+frL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 𝟏𝟎𝟎% 𝐋𝐈𝐅𝐄𝐓𝐈𝐌𝐄 𝐖𝐀𝐑𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐓𝐘: Customer satisfaction is our priority. If for any reason you're not completely satisfied, we will compensate you and offer extra benefits to ensure your rights. Buy with confidence! ✅ PACKAGE INCLUDE: 2 x 8536974 Dryer Drum Support Roller. Most dryers require two drum rollers. It is recommended to check and replace both drum support rollers at the same time to ensure proper drum rotation and because they often wear at the same rate. ✅ HIGH COMPATIBILITY: It is made exactly fit for most top name brands (Whirlpool, Kenmore, Maytag, KitchenAid, Amana, Crosley, Inglis) and replaces part numbers: 3388342, 3389902, 3396801, 3396802, 3401846, 8536973, 8536974, W10314171, W10314173, W10756057, WPW10314173VP. - Please check the product's specifications carefully before making a purchase. Or if you are unsure about the compatibility, feel free to contact us and we will be happy to help you. ✅ PREMIUM QUALITY: The 8536974 Dryer Drum Support Roller is made from durable high quality materials: rubber, plastic and metal, and each has been well inspected and well-tested by the manufacturer. This part fixes the following symptoms: Noisy | Will not tumble. ✅ FITS MODELS: [Kenmore] 10687884100, 10687884300, 10687884600, 110.6007299, 110.6090199, 110.6090299, 110.6095799, 110.6099299, 11060936990, 11062182103, 11062902100, 11062924100, 11062932100, 11062936100, 11062942100, 11062952100, 11062954100, 11062974100, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R1AgX+frL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueStars","source_asin":"B0C7TLL2GB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7TLL2GB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7TLL2GB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":112196,"name":"4Pin Refrigerator Over Load Protector Compressor PTC Starter Relay for Haier for Siemens for Hotpoint Freezer Accessories ZHB35-120P15 Replace ZHB69-1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QGs-63psL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Note】This product is not a panacea (Not Universal). Please carefully compare the picture with your old parts to make sure it fits your refrigerator. Don't buy if you are unsure. Tips: If the refrigerator compressor is broken, this relay will not work. The product is fragile and may be damaged during transportation. After receiving the product, please conduct quality test according to the eighth picture. 4Pin ZHB35-120P15 repalcement part PTC chip's tested resistance is about 13Ω-18Ω (The eighth test picture). Size about 1.77x1.26x1.07inch. If your compressor is not starting, But burning hot and \"click-clack\" about every 3-5 minutes when powered on. It could be the start relay that is causing the issue. Our fridge start relay parts is your best choice. As long as the appearance and shape of the relay are exactly the same, it can basically be used universally. Compatible to replace multiple models, eg. ZHB35-105P15, ZHB35-135P15, ZHB54-105P15, ZHB54-120P15, ZHB54-120P4.7, ZHB60-120P4.7, ZHB88-125P4.7, ZHB40-105P15, ZHB48-125P15, ZHB54-120P15, ZHB60-120P15, ZHB65-120P15, ZHB69-135P4.7, but Not fit ZKB69-135P4.7. This refrigerators parts accessory product can be applied to multiple brands, such as Fitment for Haier for Panasonic for Siemens for Samsung for LG for Vissani for Danby for MAGIC for CHEF for KENMORE And Others. Allows a simple repair to a common problem with many wine fridges, mini fridges, and beverage coolers. You can also take apart the 2in1 PTC stater to use the good PTC chip with your old stater's housing. PLEASE refer to the second picture for connection method.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QGs-63psL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QINIZX","source_asin":"B09D72QCSL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D72QCSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D72QCSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":112197,"name":"Whirlpool WPW10122078 OEM Bottom Freezer Refrigerator Drawer Support End Cap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.53,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ksD-mWRRL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"The Bottom Freezer Refrigerator Drawer Support End Cap snaps into place on the appliance’s pantry drawer to help contain the items inside. Note that your pantry drawer has two end caps (sold separately); this part is designed specifically to be used on the left side (from the point of view of looking into the appliance). This item is constructed of durable white plastic and can be used to easily replace a broken or missing part. This high-quality and durable replacement part is easy to install and will require no basic hand tools or repair experience, but it does involve minor disassembly of the refrigerator. Remember to unplug the refrigerator or shut off the house circuit breaker for the appliance before installing this part. Helpful Tip: Also consider replacing the right-hand Drawer Support End Cap (item WPW10121977) at the same time that you install this part.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ksD-mWRRL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B072YVDZXX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072YVDZXX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B072YVDZXX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
