window.products.push({"id":112342,"name":"Merax Ice Maker Machine Countertop, Portable Electric Ice Maker, 48 lbs/24H Ice Cube Maker with Ice Scoop and Basket for Home/Office/Bar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91p6ufzgxyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need ice cubes on demand fast and without the hassle of driving to the nearest store to get some? Well, your problem is solved with Merax countertop ice maker machine. Capable of making 24 ice cubes in as fast as 15 minutes, this portable ice cube maker is super efficient in creating 48lbs on demand over a 24-hour period. Large ice bucket to store up to 2.4 pounds of ice at a time. 3 selectable ice cube sizes by adjusting the cooling time. Easily see through the transparent window, you can monitor the ice-making cycle, water level, and when the ice cube container is full without opening the cover for proper sanitation. Built-in 2.2L large reservoir and ice basket with ice scoop. Other great features include a large heat dissipation fan for excellent cooling, convenient water drainage plug under the machine, removable ice basket and ice scoop. This portable ice maker machine works quietly and efficiently with up to 40% in energy saving. Portable ice maker machine measurements: 11.2” x 14.4” x 13.8”. Ready to use out of the box. No installation needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91p6ufzgxyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merax","source_asin":"B091Q5NT74","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091Q5NT74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B091Q5NT74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":112343,"name":"FOTILE EMS9018 36\" Wall-mount Range Hood | Touchscreen | 2 Speed-settings and Auto-Turbo Function | Delay Off Function | LED Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":999.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tUpj7cfxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"ENJOY A SMOKE-FREE KITCHEN: Featuring Surround Suction Technology and Sleek, Contemporary Design, FOTILE W Series Range Hoods are more than appliances-they are modern-day masterpieces. With Maximum Static Pressure of 397Pa with nautilus air passageway and 360-degree micropore noise reduction, maximizes the hood's extraction power while simultaneously reducing the noise generated through the air flow to 49dB / 1.87sones TOUCH SCREEN CONTROL: With 2 speed Settings, it is suitable for all kinds of cooking style. With Auto Turbo System, if , at any point during the ventilation process, your FOTILE range hood detects resistance, the unit will automatically switch to its most powerful mode for maximum extraction capacity. With Delay Function, it will ensure no smell will be left behind after you finished cooking, while you enjoy your meal. With Screen Lock Function, it prevents unit from turn on, while cleaning. WING-LIKE SURROUND SUCTION PLATE: Eliminate smoke before it can spread, This unit is designed with a wide negative core pressure area for maximum coverage while you're cooking. Smoke and other odors are quickly detected and then extracted before they can spread. INNOVATIVE VENTILATION SYSTEM: The \"Canyon effect\", the way air naturally becomes pressurized when moving from a wide area into a narrower space. A space-capsule-shape canopy to increase efficiency during the extraction process. EASY TO MAINTAIN: With Impeller, it can reach 92% of grease filtration rate; 95% odor reduction rate. Simplified mounting system lets you quickly remove and wash your range hood's filter. Smooth surface and canopy can be quickly dismounted and wiped down with a damp cloth. Large Grease Tray is easy to remove and clean. HASSLE-FREE INSTALLATION: We offer professional installation services (additional charge) in over 50 major cities, such as San Francisco, Los Angeles, and New York City. Reach out today and see if we are in your area. BEST in the INDUSTRY WARRANTY SERVICES: With over 3,500 independent service providers network covering 50 states.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tUpj7cfxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOTILE","source_asin":"B08PJ3GZSZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PJ3GZSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PJ3GZSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
