window.products.push({"id":112362,"name":"137221600 137108100 Washer Drain Pump by Beaquicy(365 DAYS WARRANTY)- Replaces 134740500 134740800 137151800 PS7783938 AP5684706 - Replacement for Ken","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xo9-vSFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 𝐒𝐔𝐏𝐏𝐎𝐑𝐓 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝐃𝐀𝐘𝐒 𝐑𝐄𝐓𝐔𝐑𝐍 & 𝐄𝐗𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐍𝐆𝐄- 𝐑𝐈𝐒𝐊-𝐅𝐑𝐄𝐄 𝐒𝐇𝐎𝐏𝐏𝐈𝐍𝐆.Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✦【DELIVERS VALUE FOR MONEY】--- 137221600 frigi-daire washer drain pump can remove the water in the washing machine in the drain part of the cycle. It includes a firmly connected red baffle to prevent drain backflow, support heavy loads and improve efficiency. You will need to remove the front panel of your washer to access the drain pump. The rated watts is 85W, 60Hz and the rated voltage is 110V-120V. The package includes 1 x 137221600 Washer drain pump, 1 x mounting base and 1 x screw. ✦【TOUGH AND LONG LASTING】--- 137221600 Washing Machine Drain Pump uses durable heavy-duty plastic structure effectively ensures compatibility, long-lasting performance and the use of washing machines. You will need to remove the front panel of your washer to access the drain pump. The part can fix the following symptoms:①Your washing machine water leaks from the bottom of the machine; ②The drum does not drain; ③There is abnormal noise during use. In these cases, please replace the drain pump in time. ✦【MADE FOR PERFECT COMPATIBILITY】--- Beaquicy 137221600 drain pump replacement Assembly fits for Ken-more, Frigi-daire Crosl-ey, Elec-trolux, Gib-son, Tap-pan, White-Westinghouse Washers. ►Replaces part numbers: 131724000, 134051200, 134740500, 134740800, 137108100, 137151800, 137151800KITK, 137151900, 137151900KITK,2754548, AP5684706, PS7783938, EAP7783938, LAFW3511KW0, CLCG500FW3, etc.𝐌𝐨𝐫𝐞 𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐦𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐢𝐧 𝐝𝐞𝐬𝐜𝐫𝐢𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧.Or you can send model number to us and we will confirm it for you. ✦【SAVE TIME SAVE MONEY】--- Disconnect the power before installing frigi-daire drain pump 137221600. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. You should prepare a Phillips screwdriver, a putty knife, a pair of slip joint pliers, and a 5/16 nut driver. Following along with an online repair video is the easiest way to ensure proper DIY installation of a water drain pump. This installation will save you money on hiring a repairman or replacing the washing machine, which is a bargain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xo9-vSFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B082X3GY76","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082X3GY76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082X3GY76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
