window.products.push({"id":112424,"name":"Stainless Steel Dishwasher Cover Magnetic Decal - #1 Replacement Dishwasher Magnet Cover (23 x 28 Inches) (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AW1IDs92L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REFRESHES YOUR APPLIANCES! ❓ Do you have an old dented dishwasher that drives you crazy? Want to make it looks BRAND NEW?  ❓ Or, want to get rid of outdated/mismatched appliances and upgrade your kitchen without breaking the bank?  Look no further! Your quest stops here! INTRODUCING ⚡MCNICK & COMPANY STAINLESS STEEL MAGNETIC DISHWASHER PANEL COVERS⚡ Our magnetic dishwasher panel cover is a perfect complement to your DIY kitchen upgrade! It measures 23.5 x 28 inches and fits 90% of dishwasher panels, but you can easily trim it to the size of the front face of your dishwasher. With our cover decal, no harsh, offensive-smelling adhesives to deal with and no massive prep work when sticking or removing! NEED MORE REASONS TO CHOOSE OUR MAGNETIC DISHWASHER PANEL COVERS? ✅ Made using a priority Brushed Silver Coating process to achieve the elegant and smooth stainless-steel finish!  ✅ Manufactured in an ISO Certified facility using a vacuum metallization process!  ✅ Can also be used on the front or sides of your refrigerator, washing machine, dryer etc.  ✅ Fade, water and heat resistant!  ✅ Smudge resistant, easy to clean and maintain!  ✅ Ship as one whole sheet, rolled up in a tube. Ready for gift giving!  ✅ 30-day no questions asked money back guarantee! SO, WHY WAIT? GET YOURS TODAY! IMPORTANT: ❗ Don’t use abrasive cleaners on the decal as they can damage the glossy finish.  ❗ Make sure your appliance has a metallic surface which attracts magnets. Take a big fridge magnet and place it onto the dishwasher. This is to test If the magnet doesn't stick neither will this product. If the magnet barley sticks this probably wont stick well or at all. Its very important you have a strong magnetic dishwasher, Most Do!  ❗ If the dishwasher cover doesn't stick use strong glue or double sided tape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AW1IDs92L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCNICK & COMPANY","source_asin":"B09FQ8KZ52","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FQ8KZ52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FQ8KZ52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
