window.products.push({"id":112513,"name":"ICEPURE NSF53&42&372Certified DA29-00003G Replacement for Samsung DA29-00003B DA29-00003A, Aqua-Pure Plus DA29-00003D DA29-00003F DA97-06317A, HAFCU1,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rO4AY8qvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✤【Authoritative Certifications】：NSF/ANSI 53,42 & 372 Lead-Free by NSF, IAPMO, European Food Grade Regulations EC-1935/2016, ROHS, REACH, BPA-Free, TUV and Australian Water Mark, Produced under quality systems ISO9001/ ISO14000. And under the supervision of the three major American authorities: IAPMO, NSF, and WQA. For higher filtering levels (NSF/ANSI 401 certified), please search for ASIN: B08R8X7TS1. ✤【Excellent Filtration Effect】: The filtering effect of this product is extremely well, which can remove many kinds of harmful impurities in the water. Certified by NSF/ASIN 42 can remove Chlorine, Bad Taste, Organic Compounds, Odor, Rust, and other solid particles. Certified by NSF/ANSI 53 can remove Cysts, Lead, Benzene, Heavy metal impurities, etc. Effectively removing heavy metal impurities in the water is the most notable feature of this water filter. ✤【100% Match & No-Leakage】: ICEPURE water filter using advanced fully automated industrial technology, The measurement technology is accurate to microns. Withstood thousands of water hammer tests, the current production process is very mature and rigorous. Installation is simple and requires no tools(With detailed installation steps). Perfectly matching the original model and no worry about leaking. ✤【Premium Filter Materials】:Top coconut shell activated carbon Certified by NSF. Unlike some low-end filtration products that use coal-based activated carbon and apricot shell activated carbon, All the products of ICEPURE filter material are 100% selected coconut shell activated carbon, which has a larger specific surface area, more micropores, and more clean. ✤【Compatible Models】:Compatible Models - DA2900003A, DA2900003B, DA2900003D, DA2900003F, DA2900003G, DA29-00003A-B, TADA29-00003A, TADA29-00003B, DA61-00159, DA61-00159A, DA61-00159A-B, DA97-06317A, HAFCU1/XAA, HAFIN2/EXP, HAFIN2, DA61-159, HAFIN1/EXP, HDX FMS-1, RF268ABRS, RF267AERS, RFG297AARS, RS22HDHPNSR, AQUACREST AQF-DA29-00003G, AQF-DA2900003G, Water drop WD-DA29-00003G, FilterLogic FL-RF11, Waterspecialist WS611B. ✤【Fit Models】:OnePurify RFC1100A, RFC 1100A, RFC0200A, UpStart Denali Pure WF-DA29-00003G, GLACIER FRESH GF-03G, Refresh R-0003, Waterfall Filter WFC2201, Dista DWF-11, Pure Line PL-700, Crystala CF6, MORE Pure Filters MPF16025, Water Filter Tree WLF-3G, Aqua Fresh WF289, ClearChoice CLCH103, Glacier Water Filters WF-107, PUREPLUS PP-RWF1100A, NuTruFlo NTF-02, PerfectPure PP1003, ALTME WQ-BX-S1, Arrowpure APF-0100, Swift Green Filters SGF-DSB30, Tier1 RWF1010, WaterSentinel WSS-1. ✤【Food-Grade Material】: Certified by NSF 372, which ensures the filter is lead-free. Food grade material， BPA-Free. Choose ICEPURE, Choose a more assured lifestyle! ✤【 Great Value for Money】: It is a great way to have a healthy and clean source of drinking water but can not worry about your budget. From now on, you won’t need to spend money on bottled water. Stay away from the invasion of plastic particles on our bodies and save money at the same time! We can say that this is a very effective refrigerator filter, which will also give you incredible value for your money. ✤【 Long Serve Life】: ICEPURE refrigerator water’s ability to remove Chlorine after testing 600 Gallons of water in the laboratory is still 99%. But in order to ensure that we can always drink clean and fresh water, we highly recommend replacing it every 6 months or 300 gallons of water filtered. It also depends on the water quality and the amount of water being filtered. Lots of users are impressed by its longevity and durability. ✤【Quality Assurance】: ICEPURE is an American company. Our factory has been producing high-quality filtration products for 20+ years. A number of products have obtained the authority certification issued by WQA, NSF401, NSF473, NSF58, NSF53, NSF42, and NSF372 certification. 24 hours/7 days customer service, ICEPURE is committed to providing high-quality after-sales protection!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rO4AY8qvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICEPURE","source_asin":"B08MSY2KR9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MSY2KR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MSY2KR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
