window.products.push({"id":112929,"name":"Broan-NuTone Elite Wall-Mounted Chimney Hood, Stainless Steel Hood with Internal Blower for Kitchen, 7.0 Sones, 370 CFM, 36\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F25u-rguL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Upgrade your kitchen with the Broan Elite Wall-Mounted Chimney Hood with Internal Blower! This stainless steel hood features a 370 CFM internal blower which operates at 7.0 Sones using 6\" round ductwork for easy installation and a quiet, effective performance. It includes three-speed slide control that allows you to set just the right exhaust speed to keep up with your cooking. This hood features dual 20-Watt halogen lamps (included) which are protected within an integrated light assembly to provide bright lighting to your kitchen area. It has a dishwasher-safe aluminum filter with a quick-release latch and professional style appearance for appealing looks and easy care. Heat Sentry adjusts speed of blower to High automatically in case of excess heat, to prolong product life. The ducted/non-ducted telescopic flue accommodates ceiling heights from 8 to 9 feet (included). The 36\" Broan Elite Wall-Mounted Chimney Hood with Internal Blower is perfect for your kitchen. From the Manufacturer Since 1932, Broan-NuTone LLC has led the industry with forward-thinking residential ventilation products, unsurpassed built-in convenience products and superior customer service. While global expertise plays a critical role in Broan-NuTone’s ability to being able to meet and exceed the needs and desires of homeowners and designers alike, Broan-NuTone is very proud of the fact that over 80 percent of their products sold in the United States are designed, engineered and manufactured in the United States with U.S. and imported parts. Manufacturing operations in the United States are located in Hartford, Wisconsin and Cleburne, Texas, with customer and technical services located in Hartford and in Cincinnati, Ohio. Broan-NuTone is committed to developing revolutionary products that improve the indoor environment as well as implementing procedures to preserve the outdoor environment. Broan-NuTone offers a wide selection of products that help meet the requirements of all three major green building programs: ENERGY STAR, U.S. Green Building Council’s (USGBC) Leadership in Energy and Environmental Design (LEED) for Homes, and the National Association of Home Builder’s (NAHB) Model Green Home Building Guidelines. Broan-NuTone’s inspiring heritage provides the foundation for its three award-winning, global brands-Broan, NuTone and BEST. Broan is the industry leader of range hoods, ventilation fans, heater/fan/light combination units, Indoor Air Quality (IAQ) Fresh Air Systems, built-in heaters, whole-house fans, solar powered attic ventilators and trash compactors. NuTone holds major market positions in door chimes, central vacuum systems, stereo intercom systems, home theater speakers, medicine cabinets, ironing centers, ceiling fans and ventilation fans. BEST range hoods are the “Ultimate in Kitchen Ventilation\" featuring state-of-the-art performance and Italian design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F25u-rguL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan-NuTone","source_asin":"B01EM0F66G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EM0F66G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EM0F66G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
