window.products.push({"id":112978,"name":"nukka Milk Frothing Pitcher 12oz - Stainless Steel Steaming Cup with Measurement Lines - Perfect for Cappuccino, Espresso, and Latte - Comes with Art ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21xGe2UZfpL._AC_.jpg","description":"nukka Milk Frothing Pitcher with art pen and stencils Always dreamt of becoming a master coffee barista? Well, we have the perfect set of professional utensils to achieve your dreams! What is frothing? \"Frothing\" is the process of creating \"microbubbles\" in the milk by blowing hot air (or steam) through the milk. Skim milk will produce a more lavish froth than whole milk. In fact, it may be hard to get whole milk to froth at all, although whole milk will have a creamier taste. Partially skimmed milk (2%) is recommended. It is easy to froth, and it will have a creamy taste. Become a milk frothing expert - Fill the frothing pitcher 1/3 of the way with milk, it will double in volume during the frothing process. - Ideally, the frothing pitcher should be at the same temperature as the milk, and both should be as cold as possible.- Place the tip of the steam wand into the milk so that the tip is about 1⁄2 inch below the surface of the milk and open the steam all the way at first.- Hold the pitcher level, but keep the, slightly slanted, steam wand near the side of the pitcher this will create a natural \"whirlpool\".- Keep frothing until you have made the texture that bests suits your tastes.- If the bubbles are too large, you can break them down by banging the pitcher onto a surface, by stirring the milk or by gently swirling the milk. Professional Latte Art You can decorate your cappuccino by using the included decorating pen and 3 stencils with cocoa or cinnamon powder and a spice shaker. The circle of foam in the latte can be used to make latte art. Main Features: - Premium Non-rust food- grade stainless steel- Dishwasher safe- Modern minimalistic design- Measurement scales on both sides inside (metric/imperial)- Ergonomic heat resistant grip- Dripless pour Included in this offer - 12oz Milk Frothing Pitcher- Latte Art Decorating Pen- 3 Stencils","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21xGe2UZfpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nukka","source_asin":"B07Q3WZPCH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-112978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q3WZPCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q3WZPCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
